[00:32.000]
[00:34.185]Legends aren't born that way
{"传奇并非与生俱来"}
[00:38.834]But by deeds
{"而是由事迹铸就"}
[00:40.737]Bloodline denotes nothing
{"血脉不代表任何意义"}
[00:44.898]
[00:46.220]How do towering trees grow from a seed
{"参天大树如何从种子萌芽"}
[00:49.625]And achievements rise from the ash?
{"辉煌成就在灰烬中崛起"}
[00:52.986]We endure and suffer lose and bleed
{"我们忍受痛苦 失去与流血"}
[00:56.025]Still we clash against the sky
{"依然向着苍穹发起冲击"}
[00:59.761]
[00:59.962]You and I are weak like the reeds
{"你我如同芦苇般脆弱"}
[01:06.274]But chasing flames is carved into creed
{"但追逐火焰已刻入信条"}
[01:13.106]Cleave the darkness, seize the light
{"劈开黑暗 紧握光明"}
[01:19.241]Daybreak's meant to be free
{"破晓注定属于自由"}
[01:22.601]We are gonna shatter the ties
{"我们将粉碎一切枷锁"}
[01:28.209]
[01:29.457]Time's worn away the lives
{"时光侵蚀了生命"}
[01:34.050]And bygones
{"与往事"}
[01:35.914]Leaving faith to resound
{"只留下信仰在回响"}
[01:40.337]
[01:41.409]Behold all the pioneering souls
{"看那些开拓者的灵魂"}
[01:44.737]In the gloom, they strive to flash
{"在黑暗中奋力闪耀"}
[01:48.106]Though the journey's filled with wounds and tolls
{"尽管征途布满伤痕与代价"}
[01:51.250]Still we clash against the sky
{"依然向着苍穹发起冲击"}
[01:54.666]
[01:54.930]Let's defy the judgment of flaws
{"让我们蔑视缺陷的审判"}
[02:01.442]Would rather die than kneel down or crawl
{"宁可死去也不跪地爬行"}
[02:07.937]
[02:08.474]Cleave the darkness, seize the light
{"劈开黑暗 紧握光明"}
[02:14.289]Daybreak's meant to be free
{"破晓注定属于自由"}
[02:17.609]We are gonna shatter the ties
{"我们将粉碎一切枷锁"}
[02:56.370]
[02:59.939]You and I are weak like the reeds
{"你我如同芦苇般脆弱"}
[03:06.497]But chasing flames is carved into creed
{"但追逐火焰已刻入信条"}
[03:13.081]Cleave the darkness, seize the light
{"劈开黑暗，紧握光明"}
[03:19.218]A brand new dawn's within reach
{"崭新的黎明触手可及"}
[03:22.529]We are gonna make it untied
{"我们终将挣脱束缚"}
[03:33.761]
[03:34.299]
